message: "If you use Python Learning Studio Ultra in research, teaching, or software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Python Learning Studio Ultra: An Interactive Python and Computational Civil Engineering Learning Environment"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bahram Beigi"
    given-names: "Yousef"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-16"
url: "https://y0bahrambeigi.github.io/bhb/python-learning-studio-pro/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/y0bahrambeigi/bhb/tree/main/python-learning-studio-pro"
abstract: >-
  Python Learning Studio Ultra is a Persian-first interactive learning environment
  for Python programming, scientific computing, and computational civil engineering.
  It combines Monaco Editor, browser-based Python execution with Pyodide, NumPy,
  Matplotlib, automated exercises and tests, multi-stage quizzes, achievements,
  civil-engineering examples, text-to-speech learning support, PWA capabilities,
  and cross-platform packaging workflows.
keywords:
  - Python
  - civil engineering
  - structural engineering
  - scientific computing
  - engineering education
  - Pyodide
  - NumPy
  - Matplotlib
  - PWA
  - computational engineering
